<p>I loved this one, especially with the included log of the containment breach.<br />
I also enjoy all the comments asking &quot;well, what if all the people who interacted with it really were bad, and it just needs to meet someone nice&quot;? Personally, I think that it's just an awful entity, and part of the awfulness is getting the victims - or in this case the readers - to somehow think this hideous fate is deserved. It's the abuser saying &quot;now look what you made me do&quot;.<br />
To be sure, you could test the &quot;punish the wicked&quot; theory using someone who is almost guaranteed to be good, like a child. But if you're wrong, it would be monstrous.<br />
I love SCPs that don't wrap everything up nicely but leave some unsolved questions.</p>

